%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: UnitStringData(Name, Description)_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d353da8880899394da8cc45b97dbe901, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 28433694720
    m_Localized: Peasant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083328
    m_Localized: "\"I\u2019ll defend the land our children will inherit!\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083329
    m_Localized: Brave peasants who took up their tools to defend their homes from
      sudden invasion. Though untrained, years of farm work have given them remarkable
      stamina and perseverance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083330
    m_Localized: Hunter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083331
    m_Localized: '"Even beasts defend their land with their lives."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083332
    m_Localized: Skilled hunters who can strike moving targets with well-aimed arrows.
      They joined the Righteous Army to fight invaders who seized their hunting grounds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083333
    m_Localized: Scythe Spearman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083334
    m_Localized: "\"I\u2019ve cut enough grass to make a mountain!\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083335
    m_Localized: Wields a sickle-spear made by attaching a blade to a spear shaft.
      Effective in both thrusting and slashing, but difficult to handle without a
      well-trained body.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083336
    m_Localized: Trooper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083337
    m_Localized: "\"I\u2019ll take the front. Cover me!\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083338
    m_Localized: Bold fighters who carry shields instead of sickles. Armed with shields
      and maces, they charge headlong into enemy lines and break their formation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083339
    m_Localized: Archer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083340
    m_Localized: '"One arrow, one foe. Every shot must count."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083341
    m_Localized: Hunters trained in disciplined archery and defensive tactics. Calm
      under pressure, they follow commands carefully and strike their targets with
      precision.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083342
    m_Localized: Musketeer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083343
    m_Localized: '"Gunfire scared me once. Now I can hunt tigers!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083344
    m_Localized: For skilled hunters, the matchlock opened a new path in battle.
      They are still learning the weapon and spend much of their time mastering its
      slow reload.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083345
    m_Localized: Ascetic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083346
    m_Localized: '"Training means nothing without action."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083347
    m_Localized: Ascetics who once trained in seclusion deep in the mountains. Rumor
      says they can defeat a tiger barehanded. Their hardened bodies make them formidable
      in close combat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083348
    m_Localized: Willow Maiden
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083349
    m_Localized: '"I wish to help. I can at least lift spirits."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083350
    m_Localized: A talented performer and artist who volunteered for the army. Those
      who mistake her grace and beauty for weakness may quickly come to regret it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083351
    m_Localized: Pikeman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083352
    m_Localized: '"Take one more step, and you will not survive!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083353
    m_Localized: Uses the long reach of a spear to deal deadly blows to approaching
      enemies. Powerful thrusts can even disrupt enemy formations.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083354
    m_Localized: Scytheman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083355
    m_Localized: '"Mercy would only be wasted on them."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083356
    m_Localized: A warrior who wields a heavy war scythe with both sharpness and
      force. Wide, ruthless sweeps cut down enemies and deny them any chance to approach.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083357
    m_Localized: Crusher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083358
    m_Localized: '"No one can match my strength. Care to test it?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083359
    m_Localized: A strongman hardened by hauling rocks and timber. On the battlefield,
      he becomes the hammer of the assault force, smashing enemy formations and refusing
      to back down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083360
    m_Localized: Shield Guard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083361
    m_Localized: '"I may fall, but I will never retreat."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083362
    m_Localized: A living wall armed with a long shield. No matter how many enemies
      advance, they stand firm, form a defensive line, and protect their comrades.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083363
    m_Localized: Master Archer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083364
    m_Localized: '"The wind is not calculated. It is overcome."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083365
    m_Localized: Archers of flawless accuracy earn the title of Master Archer. Their
      precise shots can turn the tide of battle, and their discipline sets an example
      for those around them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083366
    m_Localized: Master Gunner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083367
    m_Localized: '"Hear the steps, judge the range, then fire."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083368
    m_Localized: Now skilled enough to reload swiftly and fire at the perfect moment
      for a fatal hit. They can also use grenades to turn the tide of battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083369
    m_Localized: Daoist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083370
    m_Localized: '"Wuji, Taiji; heaven, earth, and man are one."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083371
    m_Localized: Through cultivation, this Daoist grasped the laws of nature and
      mastered mysterious arts. A simple sweep of the fan can stir winds that grow
      into violent gales.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083372
    m_Localized: Warrior Monk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083373
    m_Localized: "\"With Ksitigarbha\u2019s heart, we save the innocent!\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083374
    m_Localized: A monk devoted to Buddhist awakening who broke his vows to defend
      the land and its people. In battle, he takes on the fierce duty of the Four
      Heavenly Kings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083375
    m_Localized: Shaman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083376
    m_Localized: '"The spirits of this land will judge your sins!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083377
    m_Localized: A medium between gods and humans who sees the unseen and hears the
      unheard. When the greed of invaders is sensed, curses are cast without hesitation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083378
    m_Localized: Healer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083379
    m_Localized: '"Needles heal or harm. Only the point differs."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083380
    m_Localized: Experts in acupuncture and herbal medicine. They came to the front
      lines to stop enemies with poisoned needles and restore allies with medicine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083381
    m_Localized: Thorn Spearman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083382
    m_Localized: '"No formation can stand before my thorns!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083383
    m_Localized: Charges into enemy ranks while sweeping a nangseon spear covered
      in sharp branching points. Excels at rapidly breaking even the strongest defensive
      formations.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083384
    m_Localized: Soul Reaper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083385
    m_Localized: '"No more invasions. I will reap your souls..."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083386
    m_Localized: A warrior with a massive scythe, feared by enemies as a reaper of
      the battlefield. The terrifying blade is swung without mercy, sending foes
      toward the afterlife.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083387
    m_Localized: Linebreaker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083388
    m_Localized: "\"Let\u2019s see if your shield can stop my mace!\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083389
    m_Localized: A fearless warrior who swings a gigantic mace as if it were a toy.
      Each blow from the fearsome weapon crushes bodies and tears apart enemy formations.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083390
    m_Localized: Diamond Guard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083391
    m_Localized: '"I am diamond! I am unyielding stone!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083392
    m_Localized: A pillar of the battlefield with a will as hard as diamond and a
      body as firm as rock. The determination to protect others makes this warrior
      even stronger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28442083393
    m_Localized: Divine Archer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277632
    m_Localized: '"My target already exists within my mind."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277633
    m_Localized: An uncanny archer whose arrows strike even unseen targets. Enemies
      panic as shots pierce through the mist and find their mark without fail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277634
    m_Localized: Divine Gunner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277635
    m_Localized: '"Only overwhelming firepower brings victory!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277636
    m_Localized: A master of firearms and grenades whose explosive firepower has
      led many battles to victory. Deadly shots pierce key targets while grenades
      erase clustered foes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277637
    m_Localized: Divine Sage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277638
    m_Localized: '"Know harmony, and ride the wave, not fight it."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277639
    m_Localized: A transcendent master who understands the harmony of heaven, earth,
      and humanity. Their mysterious arts become a great trial for enemies and a
      source of confidence for allies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277640
    m_Localized: Great Monk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277641
    m_Localized: '"All things are but dreams and illusions."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277642
    m_Localized: With unwavering composure, this monk sees through appearances and
      becomes a spiritual pillar for the Righteous Army. Gentle yet resolute words
      bring comfort to those who fight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277643
    m_Localized: Grand Shaman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277644
    m_Localized: '""'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277645
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277646
    m_Localized: Fairy Maiden
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277647
    m_Localized: '""'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277648
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277649
    m_Localized: Forced Laborer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277650
    m_Localized: '"If ordered to die, I die. What else is there?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277651
    m_Localized: A forced laborer dragged to Joseon from abroad. Once an ordinary
      farmer or fisher, he now grips a bloodstained axe in a foreign land, swinging
      it with the hollow defiance of a life denied.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277652
    m_Localized: Shady Merchant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277653
    m_Localized: '"Care to trade? One knife for a thousand sacks?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277654
    m_Localized: A shameless trader who can fleece anyone in a few words. Knowing
      the market price helps, though he insists he is not completely without conscience.
      His thick skin seems literal, as he is slightly tougher than most.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277655
    m_Localized: Sly Interpreter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277656
    m_Localized: '"No trade happens without my approval. Clear?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277657
    m_Localized: A low-ranking official obsessed with control. He claims every trade
      is invalid without him. With no notable skill or talent, his authority comes
      from rank alone. He lectures strangers and raises a hand to intimidate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277658
    m_Localized: Desperate Bomber
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277659
    m_Localized: '"My life is only as long as this fuse. Heh."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277660
    m_Localized: "One who swore loyalty to the Empire\u2014or was made to believe
      he did. At a command, he straps on explosives, charges into enemy lines, and
      detonates. Those who see his fanatical grin rarely sleep well afterward."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277661
    m_Localized: Desperate Sniper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277662
    m_Localized: '"One arrow, one enemy. The count must be exact."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277663
    m_Localized: An archer sworn to the Emperor. Training and indoctrination stripped
      away his humanity until only aim and release remained. Accuracy matters more
      than survival, so he keeps drawing the bow until his final breath.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277664
    m_Localized: Unyielding Monk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277665
    m_Localized: '"You know the answer: I believe. Or, I believe!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277666
    m_Localized: A mental instructor who implants imperial doctrine. Ally, enemy,
      or villager, all must kneel before the creed. He wields magic and rhetoric
      as weapons, eroding the minds of those around him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277667
    m_Localized: Unyielding Blade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277668
    m_Localized: '"It was destined to happen. Why should I fear it?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277669
    m_Localized: A swordsman from a lineage of warriors, burdened by family, nation,
      and tradition. He taunts enemies into attacking him to protect allies, treating
      the battlefield as a place of honor even when death awaits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277670
    m_Localized: Deadly Warrior
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277671
    m_Localized: '"Any hand reaching for the Emperor gets cut off!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277672
    m_Localized: A royal guard who once stood closest to the Emperor. His armored
      body is faster than a spear and harder than a shield. To him, protection means
      striking first, and anyone who reaches for the Emperor falls first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277673
    m_Localized: Handcannon Fiend
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277674
    m_Localized: '"The Sun never rests. Therefore, neither can I."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277675
    m_Localized: Once a laborer, he caught the Emperor's eye and was forged into
      a human weapon. He sees obedience as a second life granted by the Emperor.
      The gun in his hand is its symbol, ready to burn foreign lands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277676
    m_Localized: Redmaw War God
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277677
    m_Localized: '"I do not raise a sword. I reveal the Sun''s will."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277678
    m_Localized: The heart of the legion leading the Empire's advance, revered as
      the Sun's Incarnation. His Diamond Body aura reduces damage taken by allies,
      while his closeness to the Emperor alone drives their morale higher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277679
    m_Localized: Priest Haeoreum
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277680
    m_Localized: '"My words are the Sun''s. Bow before the Sun!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277681
    m_Localized: The Emperor's right hand, convinced that he speaks as a divine agent.
      He sees all outsiders as uncivilized people who cannot comprehend the Emperor's
      will.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277682
    m_Localized: Cult Pioneer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277683
    m_Localized: "\"Till the soil or take a head\u2014I'll do as told!\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277684
    m_Localized: A civilian lured across the sea by a false faith. Seeking a new
      land for their promised kingdom, he came as far as Joseon. Thoroughly brainwashed,
      he will obey any order, even looting and murder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277685
    m_Localized: Cult Slave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277686
    m_Localized: '"I''ll obey... Spare me, please."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277687
    m_Localized: A captive forced into menial labor by the cult. Rage once burned
      after home and family were taken, but years of beatings crushed it into numb
      obedience. The cult now uses his broken body as a disposable shield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277688
    m_Localized: Toxin Carrier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277689
    m_Localized: '"I''ll do anything... just let me rest a moment..."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277690
    m_Localized: A captive assigned the cult's most dangerous work. Poison meant
      for new settlements has discolored his skin and dulled his pain. On death,
      the toxins within him escape as gas, with a 20% chance to inflict Poisoned.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277691
    m_Localized: Mad Sentry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277692
    m_Localized: '"No bug gets near our leader. Sacred duty!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277693
    m_Localized: A low-ranking cult soldier assigned as a sentry after failing to
      earn glory. The title alone seems to fuel his zeal. Neither strong nor tough,
      he still fires wildly at anything that threatens the cult leader.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277694
    m_Localized: Mad Scout
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277695
    m_Localized: '"Burn with zeal! I am our leader''s eyes!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471936
    m_Localized: A wide-ranging scout who radiates Battle Zeal to nearby allies.
      He fires a small gun at range and thrusts up close. Light armor makes him tougher
      than a sentry, and fanaticism keeps him reckless.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471937
    m_Localized: Mad Executor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471938
    m_Localized: '"Unbeliever, repay your sin with your blood!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471939
    m_Localized: 'An executioner who judges those branded heretics. By killing anyone
      who strays from the cult''s teachings, he believes he enforces justice. Only
      one belief burns in his eyes: blood washes away sin.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471940
    m_Localized: Mad Miner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471941
    m_Localized: '"Golden revelation whispered: Blow it all up!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471942
    m_Localized: A miner who became obsessed with explosives underground. Now he
      follows golden revelations, straps bombs across his body, and charges the enemy.
      To him, death proves his faith, so he detonates with a manic smile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471943
    m_Localized: Fallen Vanguard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471944
    m_Localized: '"Advance! Our steps shall open the path of God!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471945
    m_Localized: Once a pioneer captain, he became an agent of destruction and conquest
      under cult orders. Slow but sturdy, he sees each advance not as a charge, but
      as a sacred rite strengthened by delusions of divine will.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471946
    m_Localized: Dark Inquisitor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471947
    m_Localized: '"Speak the truth. Or I will make you scream."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471948
    m_Localized: An inquisitor who believes divine will is revealed through a heretic's
      pain. Torture is purification, screams are repentance, and his axe is not a
      weapon but a gift that forces the cult's love into its victims.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471949
    m_Localized: Fallen Guardian
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471950
    m_Localized: '"Whatever it is, if it comes near, kill it."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471951
    m_Localized: Once hired to protect local people, this guard was brainwashed into
      serving the cult instead. Armed with only a sword and obsession, his corrupted
      faith has made him stubborn, relentless, and merciless.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471952
    m_Localized: Fallen Preacher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471953
    m_Localized: '"You can be healed. All you need is faith."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471954
    m_Localized: A preacher of false salvation. He heals the wounded while binding
      them to the cult in God's name. The power flowing from his staff is less medicine
      than a chain meant to capture the soul.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471955
    m_Localized: Judge Zeroel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471956
    m_Localized: '"Doubt is sin, and my blade is where sin ends."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471957
    m_Localized: A cold-blooded zealot wearing the mask of holiness. Judge Zeroel
      hunts heretics through absolute doctrine and imposes his own justice. His provocations
      are a tolling bell that calls fanaticism forth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471958
    m_Localized: Paladin Edward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471959
    m_Localized: '"My hammer seals justice. Ready for judgment?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471960
    m_Localized: Edward speaks of light and truth like a paladin, yet his hammer
      brings no mercy. A sacred destroyer who embodies the cult's will, he crushes
      every heretic in the name of God.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471961
    m_Localized: Henry the Greedy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471962
    m_Localized: '"Even your souls are fuel for my temple."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471963
    m_Localized: The cult's absolute ruler, almost demonic in how he exploits souls
      and wealth through promises of faith and salvation. Henry possesses hypnotic
      charm and whispers venomous prayers behind a humble smile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471964
    m_Localized: Mercenary Archer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471965
    m_Localized: '"Please don''t compare me with those amateurs."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471966
    m_Localized: "A professional mercenary who volunteered to earn money for a harsh
      desert homeland. Trained from childhood, she has high strength and stamina\u2014and
      equally high pride. Her archery is brutal, clean, and efficient."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471967
    m_Localized: Trained Vaulter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471968
    m_Localized: '"This? Consider it a warm-up."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471969
    m_Localized: A professional mercenary trained from childhood for mobility. An
      excellent skirmisher, he uses a long spear both to attack and to vault over
      barricades, bypassing defensive lines with ease.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471970
    m_Localized: Mercenary Killer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471971
    m_Localized: '"...You can see me? Tch. Just this once, then."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471972
    m_Localized: An elite mercenary trained in stealth and assassination. Few ever
      glimpse such killers, yet sightings are oddly common in Joseon. Some say the
      golden fields remind them of home and dull their desert-born caution.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471973
    m_Localized: Mirage Medic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471974
    m_Localized: '"Medicine and prayer. Now, stop bleeding."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471975
    m_Localized: A healer who combines desert medicine with ritual magic. Her hands
      stop bleeding, mend bones, and calm fear with uncanny skill. Refined crystals
      channel restorative light, making each treatment feel like a rite.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471976
    m_Localized: Mirage Slayer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471977
    m_Localized: '"Don''t plan on living. I''ve erased even my name."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471978
    m_Localized: A shadow called the 'formless blade' even among Moor mercenaries.
      An extreme assassin skilled in infiltration and massacre, he coats his weapon
      in potent poison and follows the sound of enemy breath.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471979
    m_Localized: Mirage Ranger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471980
    m_Localized: '"Whatever blocks the way, we cross it."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471981
    m_Localized: An elite skirmisher who infiltrates faster than anyone. With a flexible
      pole-spear, he pierces enemies and vaults over walls or pits alike. Once he
      spots an opening, his silhouette vanishes like a mirage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471982
    m_Localized: Mirage Charger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471983
    m_Localized: '"Stop moving and you die. Simple, isn''t it?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471984
    m_Localized: A frontline mercenary who opens paths with her shield and creates
      openings with her sword. Her Swift Feet aura lightens her allies' steps. Born
      in a desert where stopping means death, she never slows down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471985
    m_Localized: Dawn Demjimor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471986
    m_Localized: '"Stand behind me. Their blades won''t touch you."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471987
    m_Localized: A legendary Moor captain whose strength reshaped the mercenary world.
      More than a swordsman, he anchors the battlefield. His guard aura grants Diamond
      Body, turning his formation into a moving fortress.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87099738619015168
    m_Localized: Priestess Katala
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87099739860529152
    m_Localized: '"Defy my voice, and you will kneel."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87099740934270976
    m_Localized: Katala no longer needs weapons to conquer a battlefield. Her voice,
      sermons, and gaze alone intimidate enemies. Her oracle book holds prophecies
      and curses; whether they kneel from faith or fear, the result is obedience.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
